{
  "id": "doc-faculty-card",
  "brand": "doc",
  "title": "DOC Faculty Card",
  "category": "ads",
  "purpose": "faculty",
  "description": "A ticket for one faculty member: portrait, name, role and what they teach",
  "useWhen": "DOC introduces one faculty member and their session.",
  "notWhen": "there are several speakers (use `DOC Live Session`).",
  "paperFileId": "01M4GYN0DT5HC9MZK7YVRYA3CW",
  "guidance": [
    "image-portrait: the person's real photo, from Assets or a link. Never generated; a grey silhouette holds its place until it comes.",
    "name and role: only as the requester gives them (\"Owner, Practice Name\"). session: what they teach, one line.",
    "cta: no full stop. By theme: Foundations \"Join the waitlist\" (Foundations only), Startup \"Enroll now\", Acquisition \"Register now\", Dark \"Apply today\", Light \"Get started\" — unless the brief gives its own action.",
    "Copy in US English, in the DOC voice: plain, specific, second person, no exclamation marks. Never invent a figure, price, date, module count, quote or name.",
    "Themes: Foundations, Startup and Acquisition are the three tracks (red, purple, green grounds): use the one the piece is about, never mix tracks. Dark and Light are neutral, for the collective as a whole."
  ],
